{"id":"658780","name":"蒸臭豆腐","author":"六San公子","authorId":"10289388","desc":"","cover":"images/658780/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"臭豆腐","amount":"4块"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"臭豆腐4块。","img":"images/658780/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"臭豆腐洗净。","img":"images/658780/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"洗净的臭豆腐用手掰成小块放碗里，撒上一层薄盐。","img":"images/658780/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"撒上辣椒面。","img":"images/658780/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放上适量猪油。","img":"images/658780/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"继续铺上第二层臭豆腐，撒盐、辣椒面，放上猪油，入蒸锅蒸10—15分钟。","img":"images/658780/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"取出蒸熟的臭豆腐，放入适量葱花，猪油烧热后焦到葱花上。","img":"images/658780/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"成品图（食用时搅拌均匀即可）。","img":"images/658780/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/658780/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}